# Player Legacy Experience (#002)

Profile is **digital identity** — Xbox/Steam-tier gaming profile, not a sportsbook account.

## Feel

"I've built something." Identity · reputation · accomplishment · belonging.

## Required sections (target)

Header (avatar, tier, streaks, share) → Legacy dashboard → Trophy case → Timeline → Sport stats

## Tiers

Bronze → Immortal. Unlock frames, badges, drops, animations, recognition.

## Reputation

Earned via games, picks, followers, referrals, achievements — not chat votes.

## Future-ready

New games must feed legacy/stats/reputation via platform stats adapter — no profile redesign per game.

Full spec: `docs/PLAYER_LEGACY_EXPERIENCE.md`
